!!<*yamlover: $defs: chapter>
Single-quoted
description: the literal style — yaml/single, with quote doubling
- |
  `name: 'Rex'` — the single-quoted style. Everything between the quotes is literal; the
  only escape is the doubled quote (`'it''s'`). In YAML `'` and `"` are interchangeable
  delimiters — which is exactly why yamlover's literal-versus-interpreted distinction
  rides on backslash escaping, not on the quote choice.
